{"id":"03aa19ec1478e924","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-thm-gitik.md","title":"Gitik's Theorem","display":"thm-gitik — Gitik's Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-gitik","aliases":["58-thm-gitik"],"display":"thm-gitik — Gitik's Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-singular]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-gitik"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-gitik</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-gitik — Gitik's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"02120307ea943054\" href=\"?note=02120307ea943054\" title=\"58-df-singular\">58-df-singular</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}:\\mathsf{Theory}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}:\\mathsf{Theory}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZF},\\mathrm{ZFC}\\in\\mathsf{Theory}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZF},\\mathrm{ZFC}\\in\\mathsf{Theory}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PCSC}\">\\(\\mathsf{PCSC}\\)</span> is the metatheory code for “there is a proper class of strongly compact cardinals”</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AUS}\">\\(\\mathsf{AUS}\\)</span> is the metatheory code for the sentence “every uncountable cardinal is singular”</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gitik} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\mathsf{PCSC})\\to\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{ZF}+\\mathsf{AUS})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gitik} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\mathsf{PCSC})\\to\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{ZF}+\\mathsf{AUS})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Gitik's result is a relative-consistency theorem: from sufficiently many strongly compact cardinals one obtains a model of ZF in which every uncountable cardinal is singular.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span> is not included: it is regular, so the former “every infinite cardinal is singular” conclusion was inconsistent.</li>\n<li>Such a model necessarily fails the axiom of choice; the statement is not an instance of the singular cardinal hypothesis.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-singular","status":"resolved","id":"02120307ea943054","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-singular]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}:\\mathsf{Theory}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZF},\\mathrm{ZFC}\\in\\mathsf{Theory}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PCSC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{AUS}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gitik} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\mathsf{PCSC})\\to\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{ZF}+\\mathsf{AUS})","display":true},{"tex":"\\aleph_0","display":false}],"bytes":1196,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4184","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-thm-gitik.md|58-thm-gitik]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1","02120307ea943054"]}